{
    "word": "criminologist",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "361a156d-15bc-3a14-bf9d-e44e0e95ecfc",
                "word": "criminologist",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0b271d78-7997-429d-a923-3dfbe9f9ff1d",
                        "entry_id": "361a156d-15bc-3a14-bf9d-e44e0e95ecfc",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "criminologists"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ca069aa-85eb-3c6e-a9b8-2ab61050d8d4",
                        "entry_id": "361a156d-15bc-3a14-bf9d-e44e0e95ecfc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who is skilled in, or practices criminology."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a89bcdda-0462-4fdc-9aa9-2a2fc059486c",
                                "sense_id": "5ca069aa-85eb-3c6e-a9b8-2ab61050d8d4",
                                "text": "Not according to professor James Alan Fox, a criminologist at Northeastern University in Boston who has been studying mass murder for the past three decades."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3241b4da-43b1-4591-aa14-a90cc58e676c",
                                "sense_id": "5ca069aa-85eb-3c6e-a9b8-2ab61050d8d4",
                                "text": "When he finished his stint in Brooklyn, Weisburd decided to team up with Larry Sherman, another young criminologist."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe338c94-776b-46d3-8b5c-8eb11465cb2f",
                                "sense_id": "5ca069aa-85eb-3c6e-a9b8-2ab61050d8d4",
                                "text": "Derived from the Latin words \"scelero\" — which means crime or wickedness — and \"phobos\" meaning fear — scelerophobia is coined by both criminologists and psychologists as the fear of burglars, according to Ayla Faisal, a clinical psychologist and a PhD scholar at the Institute of Clinical Psychology at the University of Karachi."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b7b0b778-862d-4d46-8eee-2d6cfa75bae0",
                        "source_entry_id": "361a156d-15bc-3a14-bf9d-e44e0e95ecfc",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ca069aa-85eb-3c6e-a9b8-2ab61050d8d4",
                        "source_sense_description": "person who practices criminology",
                        "target_lang_word": "criminoloog",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "criminoloog",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf1c52e4-9bcf-34ba-bc2c-5545a2127900",
                                        "entry_id": "6a8b96da-adb7-3e15-a21b-7bdfe380a8a8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "beoefenaar van de criminologie"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "beroep"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d7e2bf5-2ba8-4053-b389-605b346b8aa0",
                                                "sense_id": "cf1c52e4-9bcf-34ba-bc2c-5545a2127900",
                                                "text": "Als criminoloog maak je geen regels en ga je ook niet straffen. Je bestudeert het hoe en waarom van crimineel gedrag en onderzoekt wat criminaliteit is."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "666145a9-67ba-4756-8170-dbe32e1b0abb",
                                                "sense_id": "cf1c52e4-9bcf-34ba-bc2c-5545a2127900",
                                                "text": "De latere criminoloog zag verschrikkelijke dingen, waarover hij nog steeds liever in understatements praat. ‘Laat ik zeggen dat er in het kamp geen grond te vinden bleek voor de aanname: de mens is goed.’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ec50c64-abb0-492b-bcfb-7db9ab87dd3a",
                                                "sense_id": "cf1c52e4-9bcf-34ba-bc2c-5545a2127900",
                                                "text": "Hij kreeg hierdoor te maken met onder meer doodsbedreigingen en bommeldingen op de faculteit. In 2009 blikte de criminoloog in gesprek met het Leids Universitair Weekblad Mare terug op die periode. \"Ik schermde zo goed mogelijk mijn gezin af, maar dat lukte natuurlijk slecht.\" Zo kreeg hij ook telefonisch bedreigingen en werd er poep door de brievenbus gegooid."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "030b0d19-aae5-44ca-ba02-ac6c497e08ca",
                        "source_entry_id": "361a156d-15bc-3a14-bf9d-e44e0e95ecfc",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ca069aa-85eb-3c6e-a9b8-2ab61050d8d4",
